/bob-cli-d2/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Newborn reference notes keep their birth source_markdown [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]pointer[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]pointer-fix[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pointer-fix: make both PDF-sync executors carry the planned birth-only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source_markdown pointer into the note they write (today they rebuild [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]metadata and drop it), with regression tests for inline create intake [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and queued scan drains.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob ref attach-source adopts orphan saved-source stores[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adopt[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adopt: let `bob ref attach-source` point a reference at its own [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unreferenced render-time store after verifying it against the PDF, leave[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its code.json untouched, make --search optional, and name the repair in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the doctor orphan warning.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Deploy, verify the hook on both hosts, and backfill two weeks [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]of research references[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]backfill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pointer-fix, adopt[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]backfill: install the fixed bob on athena and apollo, apply the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hook_timeout decision, prove the hook path end to end on both hosts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then adopt orphan stores and attach hook-time Markdown to every research[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference the hook matched since 2026-10-12.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tri